[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0393","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0470","title":"Allegro RomPager URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allegro RomPager 2.10 HTTP服务器在处理畸形认证请求时存在缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的畸形HTTP认证请求触发拒绝服务漏洞，导致服务崩溃或无响应。该漏洞影响Allegro RomPager 2.10版本，CVSS评分7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送畸形认证请求触发漏洞，导致服务拒绝服务，ExploitDB编号10237已公开PoC利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0470"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48.193","remediation":"建议升级到 rompager v3.x 或更高版本，应用安全补丁，开启 URL 输入验证并配置防火墙规则限制对 vulnerable 端口的访问流量；如无法立即升级，可将页面根目录限制到安全目录并禁用不必要的服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0398.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1290","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4588","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0470.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0470","https://github.com/doodad-labs/threat-intelligence/blob/ee308632cd35c3a8b60a89f181457ce4fae96eed/data/exploits/CVE-2000-0470.10237.txt","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0470.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0470.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/allegro_dos.nasl","https://github.com/kylekirkby/Python-Exploit-Search-Tool/blob/8e84b77a6ff689ce32d04884f9ea75de04ae0433/platforms/hardware/dos/10237.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-976v-3xrm-785r/GHSA-976v-3xrm-785r.json","https://github.com/hannob/rompager-check/blob/4eea347afb3fdfd641e141ddbd3b94693ce19964/rompager.php","https://github.com/teletautala/fullypwnd/blob/04ed241d11a37105d9448c49740e78d5ca2ccf43/exploitdb/platforms/hardware/dos/.svn/text-base/10237.txt.svn-base"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0393.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0389","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0467","title":"Sam Lantinga splitvt 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sam Lantinga 的 splitvt 1.6.3 控制台工具存在严重的缓冲区溢出漏洞。此漏洞源于屏幕锁定功能的处理逻辑缺陷，当用户输入过长的密码时，会导致程序分配的缓冲区溢出。通过精心构造的超长密码，攻击者可以覆盖相邻内存区域，劫持控制流并执行任意代码，最终实现系统权限的提升。该漏洞仅影响本地用户，攻击者无需认证即可通过屏幕锁定功能发起攻击，影响 Linux 系统的安全性。受影响版本涵盖整个 splitvt 1.6.3 及其所有早期版本。攻击者需要物理访问权限或能触发屏幕锁定功能来利用此漏洞。该漏洞利用了程序内存安全管理的不足，攻击者可以利用缓冲区溢出攻击来绕过安全限制，从而获得 root 权限。这是一个典型的本地权限提升漏洞，攻击者可以利用用户在登录屏幕锁定时输入的过长密码来触发溢出，导致程序崩溃并劫持控制流，从而执行任意代码。安全性高，建议对系统进行系统补丁或升级到安全版本。此漏洞作为经典的权限提升攻击手法被广泛应用于诸多安全渗透测试中，作为安全认证体系中权限变更和提升其中的关键测试点和控制手段之一。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0467"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47.820","remediation":"建议立即升级 splitvt 至 1.6.4 或更高版本（若发行版已发布修复版本）。若无法升级，请立即移除 splitvt 二进制文件的 SUID 权限：chmod u-s /usr/bin/splitvt，或在编译选项中禁用屏幕锁定功能（--disable-lock）后重新编译安装。 Debian 用户可安装 2000 年 6 月发布的安全更新（DSA-0605），其他发行版请参考对应安全公告升级软件包。若暂无补丁，请暂时卸载 splitvt 或限制普通用户执行权限（chmod 700 /usr/bin/splitvt）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0125.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1346","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20013","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0467.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0467","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0467.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0467.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cjw-cjmh-r6rm/GHSA-6cjw-cjmh-r6rm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0467.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/l/debian-webwml/blob/80cd9461d384c50e61f7c585e566ce9d00c113fc/webwml/english/security/2000/20000605a.data","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0389.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0440","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0530","title":"KDE KDE 1.1.2 KApplication 配置文件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"KDE 1.1.2 的 KApplication 类在配置文件管理功能中存在本地权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可利用配置文件处理逻辑缺陷覆盖任意系统文件，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1.2 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且无需认证，通过构造恶意配置文件路径诱导 KApplication 写入敏感系统文件（如 /etc/passwd、/etc/shadow 或 SUID 程序），实现权限提升至 root 权限。CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为完全影响。该漏洞于 2000 年 5 月披露，ExploitDB 已有公开利用代码（EDB-ID: 19981），KDE 后续版本已修复该配置文件路径遍历漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0530"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-05-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.997","remediation":"升级到 KDE 2.0 或更高版本，其中修复了 KApplication 配置文件路径验证漏洞。修改配置文件，禁用以 \".\" 开头的潜在危险配置，并确保使用绝对安全路径而非相对路径访问系统关键文件。通过权限控制限制普通用户对关键系统文件的写权限，并检查所有配置文件变更前验证文件路径安全性和所有权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0387.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-032.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1291","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4583","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19981","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0530.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0530","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0530.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0530.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wvff-22g3-f295/GHSA-wvff-22g3-f295.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0530.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f94987a6-2d3f-459d-bbaa-e876dfa178db.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8c4383d71e419cb5a91546cd7835b4f02c87cdaa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0440.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0422","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0422.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0505","title":"Apache HTTP Server Windows 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.x Windows 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，源于对包含大量 \"/\" 字符的 URL 请求处理不当。远程未认证攻击者可发送包含大量斜杠（如 /////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////）的 HTTP GET 请求，绕过路径规范化检查，导致服务器返回 Web 根目录甚至系统根目录的文件列表，泄露敏感文件结构信息。影响版本包括 Apache 1.3.6、1.3.9、1.3.11、1.3.12、1.3.20 Windows 版本。攻击条件为：目标运行受影响版本的 Apache on Windows，攻击者可发送 HTTP 请求。CVSS 5.0（中危），攻击向量网络、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性影响。Apache 已在后续版本修复该路径规范化缺陷，建议升级至修复版本或迁移至非 Windows 平台。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0505"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.680","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.21 或更高版本（或升级至 2.x 分支），该版本修复了 Windows 平台上多重斜杠导致的根目录遍历漏洞。若暂无法升级，请在 httpd.conf 中为所有目录配置 `Options -Indexes` 禁用目录列表，并在 `<Directory />` 中设置 `Require all denied` 限制根目录访问，同时在防火墙层面拦截包含过多连续斜杠的异常请求作为临时缓解措施。升级包可从 Apache 官网 httpd.apache.org/download.cgi 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1284","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.BSF.4.20.0006031912360.45740-100000%40alive.znep.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4575","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5f9c22f9c28adbd9f00556059edc7b03a5d5bb71d4bb80257c0d34e4%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb9c9f42dafa25d2f669dac2a536a03f2575bc5ec1be6f480618aee10%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19975","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0505.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0505.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0505","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/httpd-vulnerabilities/blob/b71e143e670cd0a24ad5402f3d46c0ba20429842/cves/CVE-2000-0505.yml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0505.yaml%231","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0505.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0505.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hcmr-mv5h-wj39/GHSA-hcmr-mv5h-wj39.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_slash.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0422.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0422.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1109","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0488","title":"ITHouse Mail Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>ITHouse Mail Server 1.04 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送超长的 RCPT TO 邮件命令触发该漏洞，进而在服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 ITHouse Mail Server 1.04 的 Windows 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可从网络端发起利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0488"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50.513","remediation":"立即将 ITHouse Mail Server 升级至官方发布的无缓冲区溢出版本（版本号需 ≥ 修复版本），若厂商已停止维护该版本，则在邮件服务器前端部署 SMTP 过滤器（如 smtp-nel-filter）以拦截超长 RCPT TO 命令，同时在防火墙层面限制外部对邮件服务端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1285","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4580","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0488.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0488","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0488.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wwh9-4j47-4fcq/GHSA-wwh9-4j47-4fcq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0488.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a593987addca94d33e8613239bbbb761eaab2477/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1109.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0545","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0486","title":"Cisco TACACS+ tac_plus 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco TACACS+（tac_plus）服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送携带超长长度字段的畸形数据包触发该漏洞，导致目标设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行TACACS+服务的Cisco IOS设备，攻击条件为无需认证即可从网络远程发起请求，利用方式简单直接。CVSS评分为5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0486"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50.270","remediation":"Cisco 已发布针对 tac_plus 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞的安全补丁，建议立即升级 tac_plus 至修复该漏洞的版本，或升级受影响 Cisco IOS 版本至包含补丁的发布版本。同时应在网络边界通过访问控制列表限制仅可信管理网段可访问 TACACS+ TCP 49 端口，如临时无法打补丁，可在边界防火墙上阻断外部对该端口的访问作为缓解措施。若网络中未使用 TACACS+ 认证服务，建议在路由器与交换机上禁用相关认证配置以消除风险暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0369.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0370.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1293","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af9951ed676bcfbcd0689aad53e974095f78dc27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0486","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0486.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8ac1704ec258f0ded20dc2e1c602afda5159d6d8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/adc271babd480768bde3df62a81974dbf85b7783/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5m7-gw4j-cjhj/GHSA-g5m7-gw4j-cjhj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0486.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0486.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--608d6b4b-25cc-420a-a06c-98b9a9a3590d.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0544","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0485","title":"Microsoft SQL Server DTS 密码泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 的数据转换服务（DTS）包属性对话框存在密码明文存储缺陷，本地用户可通过查看该对话框直接读取数据库连接密码，从而获取对数据库的未授权访问权限。该漏洞利用条件低，攻击者只需具备目标系统的本地访问权限即可触发，无需网络攻击或特殊身份认证。影响范围涵盖使用 DTS 包存储数据库连接信息的所有 SQL Server 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0485"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50.143","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-041 修补程序（KB Q264880），该补丁会消除 DTS 包属性对话框和 Enterprise Manager 中密码以明文方式暴露的漏洞。若暂时无法安装补丁，可采取以下缓解措施：禁用 MSDB 数据库的 Guest 访问权限，限制 DTS 包的编辑权限仅授予所有者，使用 Windows 身份验证代替 SQL Server 身份验证来运行 DTS 包，并定期检查已注册的服务器配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/62771","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1292","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-041","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/98f5df8bf40c6af0934fb1e8baa83eb4ebb7d422/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0485.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0485","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0485.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9f14dd7a1c5691895422a824762c1dbc0caf1d9a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0485.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/797a0a07abd34902460662a11cdad773c22543c8/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a296135b4fb6684177b1ef84e538a96d91a93adb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-682g-mjx4-8wwv/GHSA-682g-mjx4-8wwv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0485.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0485.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mssql_version.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0485.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0428","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0428.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0402","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 明文密码存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 的混合模式认证（Mixed Mode Authentication）功能存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该数据库系统在日志文件中以明文形式存储系统管理员（sa）账户密码，任何具有本地系统访问权限的用户均可读取该日志文件并获取 sa 密码。攻击者利用该密码可登录 SQL Server 数据库并以最高权限执行任意 SQL 语句，甚至通过 xp_cmdshell 等扩展存储过程在服务器上执行系统命令，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞主要影响 SQL Server 7.0 版本，攻击者无需数据库认证即可通过本地文件系统访问获取高权限凭据，危害范围覆盖所有使用混合模式认证的 SQL Server 7.0 实例。Microsoft 已在后续 Service Pack 中修复此安全缺陷，建议用户升级至 SQL Server 7.0 SP3 或更高版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0402"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.473","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 或更高版本，该补丁已修复 sa 密码明文记录问题。如无法升级，建议将认证模式从 Mixed Mode 切换为 Windows 身份验证模式，并限制对 SQL Server 日志文件（ERRORLOG 等）的访问权限，仅允许管理员账户读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=263968","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1281","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-035","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0402.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0402","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0402.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0402.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/wick2o/osf_db/blob/5ff9e4fe46911948aa9cbb9aa2416b4ad7cc2e2b/exploits/5411_0.nasl","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0402.yaml","https://github.com/kylekirkby/Python-Exploit-Search-Tool/blob/8e84b77a6ff689ce32d04884f9ea75de04ae0433/platforms/windows/remote/21693.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0428.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0418","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0418.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0495","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1 的 Windows Media Encoder 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞（MS00-038），远程未认证攻击者可通过发送畸形编码器请求触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Services 4.0 和 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向目标服务器发送特制的畸形编码器请求即可触发拒绝服务，导致服务停止响应。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-038 修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或应用补丁。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 代码（EDB-ID: 19974）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0495"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-30T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51.460","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS00-038 提供的安全补丁（针对 Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1），或直接升级到 Windows Media Services 9.0 及以上版本。如暂时无法打补丁，请在防火墙层面禁止 1755 端口（MMS 协议默认端口）的外部访问，并在 IIS 中禁用 Windows Media 相关 ISAPI 扩展作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快升级至 Windows Media Services 9.0 系列以彻底修复该拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1282","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-038","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4585","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19974","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0495","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0495.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jrv6-w97f-q9vv/GHSA-jrv6-w97f-q9vv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0495.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b4da0b8e-6f0a-4a39-bb10-1561970f2401.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0418.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0656","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0564","title":"Mirabilis ICQ 2000.0a Guestbook 长URL拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ Web Front 服务的留言簿 CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送包含超长 name 参数的 URL 请求触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ICQ 2000a、99b 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，导致服务崩溃或无响应，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于可用性影响类漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0564"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00.420","remediation":"tags.<value>禁用过期的 ICQ Web Front 服务或升级到包含安全补丁的版本，建议安装 2000 年后的安全更新包，同时在 Web 服务器上启用 URL 参数长度限制并过滤恶意的长参数请求，以防止 CGI 程序被长参数消耗导致 DoS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0218.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0514","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0461","title":"NetBSD semconfig 系统调用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 及 BSD 衍生系统中存在未文档化的 semconfig 系统调用漏洞，该调用会冻结信号量的状态，导致本地用户可通过调用 semconfig 系统调用使信号量系统陷入拒绝服务状态。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 及相关 BSD 衍生系统，CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于本地拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者需具备本地用户权限且能调用 semconfig 系统调用即可触发，利用方式为直接调用该未文档化系统调用冻结信号量状态导致系统信号量机制失效，造成拒绝服务影响。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0461"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47.067","remediation":"建议立即升级至 NetBSD 9.3 或 10.0 及以上版本（该版本已移除/修复未文档化的 semconfig 系统调用）。若无法立即升级，可编译内核时排除 semconfig 系统调用（在内核配置文件中移除 semconfig 支持），或通过文件系统权限限制本地用户访问 /dev/ksyms 等接口作为临时缓解措施。同时建议限制本地用户权限，避免非必要用户获取 shell 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata26.html#semconfig","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1270","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0461.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0461.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0461","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0461.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0461.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3rxh-gp2j-2w4m/GHSA-3rxh-gp2j-2w4m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c2e7ec15-6d13-4232-b36f-4ee9b37ad606.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0502","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0455","title":"xlockmore xlock 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xlock程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞影响xlockmore xlock程序4.16及更早版本。当本地用户向程序输入过长的-mode选项参数时，会触发缓冲区溢出，导致程序试图读取超出安全边界的内存区域。此漏洞允许攻击者通过精心构造的恶意输入来读取系统内存中的敏感数据，如密码、密钥或配置文件信息。攻击者无需任何权限即可利用此漏洞进行攻击，利用过程相对简单，只需向目标程序传递包含过多字符的-mode参数即可。此外，由于漏洞位于本地权限级别，攻击者通常需要首先获得目标系统的本地访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0455"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.287","remediation":"建议立即升级 xlockmore 到 4.17 或更高版本（修复了 -mode 参数缓冲区溢出）。若无法立即升级，可卸载 xlock 或移除其 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/xlock），改用 xscreensaver 等替代屏幕锁定程序作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0375.html","http://www.nai.com/nai_labs/asp_set/advisory/41initialized.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1267","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0455","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4r8f-7gpj-fr4c/GHSA-4r8f-7gpj-fr4c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0455.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0455.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001420.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0502.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0378","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0454","title":"Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 cdrecord 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 中 cdrecord 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的 dev 参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现本地权限提升至 root 权限。该漏洞源于 cdrecord 在处理 dev 参数时未进行边界检查，攻击者仅需本地普通用户权限即可构造超长参数覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码。受影响版本为 Mandriva Linux Mandrake 7.0 默认安装的 cdrecord 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、完全影响 CIA），属于高危本地提权漏洞。攻击者仅需本地账户即可利用该漏洞获取 root 权限，建议升级至修复版本或限制 cdrecord 的 SUID 权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0454"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-29T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.153","remediation":"升级 cdrecord 到最新 patched 版本（≥3.2），或直接迁移到现代的 growisofs 或 wodim 等替代 burning 工具；同时修改配置文件，严格验证 dev 参数长度和字符集，避免包含 '..' 或特殊字符；如果无法立即更新，可临时通过修改 /etc/group 文件将 cdrecord 用户从 root 分组中移除，或在 sudoers 文件中限制 cdrecord 的权限。这样可以直接修复已知溢出漏洞，通过输入验证和权限控制提供即时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0367.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0434.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0019.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1265","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0454","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0454.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cr5m-c8fx-9pvc/GHSA-cr5m-c8fx-9pvc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0454.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d80adab4-d3f9-4600-8008-5dbce5633f21.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0378.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0504","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0456","title":"NetBSD项目组 NetBSD 1.4.2 CPU耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本内核中某些系统调用未正确释放 CPU 时间片，本地用户可通过反复调用这些不释放 CPU 的系统调用（称为 \"cpu-hog\"），独占 CPU 资源导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 NetBSD 1.4.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/仅影响可用性），攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过反复调用特定不释放 CPU 的系统调用独占处理器资源，导致系统无响应或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0456"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-28T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.423","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4.3 或更高版本（已修复该内核 CPU 占用漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可通过内核参数限制单进程 CPU 时间（如设置 kern.maxprocperuid 限制用户进程数），或使用资源限制（ulimit -t）限制单进程 CPU 时间作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1365","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0456","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0456.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2c6h-prr7-885p/GHSA-2c6h-prr7-885p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0456.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0456.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--059bd44a-700b-416a-a033-6ffc4239a7fe.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001418.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0516","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0462","title":"NetBSD ftpchroot 分析漏洞","description":"NetBSD ftpd 的 ftpchroot 功能存在路径解析漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 路径遍历序列的 FTP 命令（如 CWD、RETR 等），绕过 chroot 限制跳出受限目录，读取或写入服务器文件系统任意位置的文件。影响 NetBSD 1.4.x 及更早版本的 ftpd 服务，攻击者需拥有合法 FTP 账号并具备登录权限，通过发送精心构造的路径遍历序列即可突破 chroot 限制，导致敏感文件泄露或任意文件写入，进而可能进一步提权控制服务器。NetBSD 官方已发布补丁修复该路径解析缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0462"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-28","updated":"2000-05-28","remediation":"建议升级 NetBSD 至 1.5 及以上版本，或应用 NetBSD 官方发布的 ftpchroot 补丁（ftp://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/NetBSD/misc/security/advisories/NetBSD-SA2000-012.txt.asc）。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 ftpchroot 功能或限制 FTP 服务仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0462","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0462.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q428-rghj-777v/GHSA-q428-rghj-777v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0462.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0462.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a083d977-81b4-482d-b781-4a5a5f4218fd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0516.toml"}]